                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The raw nerve releases a burst of mental energy in a @Template[cone|distance:30], dealing @Damage[6d12[mental]|options:area-damage] damage to each creature in the cone (@Check[will|dc:31|options:area-effect,damaging-effect,inflicts:stunned] save).</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature takes no damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned]{Stunned 2}</p>"
